	WRITE_LONG 0x64 0x72
	INSERT_BYTES 0x72 0x38
	WRITE_SHORT 0x68 1
	WRITE_SHORT 0x72 1
	WRITE_LONG 0x6a 0xaa
	WRITE_LONG 0x8 RESOLVE_STR_REF(@4021)
	WRITE_LONG 0xc RESOLVE_STR_REF(@4021)
	WRITE_ASCII 0x3a ~SPPR416B~ #8
	WRITE_LONG 0x50 RESOLVE_STR_REF(~Jaws

Melee damage: 1D3 (Piercing)
Speed Factor: 2
Range: 2 feet
Poison: deals one damage per 40 seconds for 10 turns (saves vs poison/death at +2).~)
